    Spell that gives this card 500 ATK. When a monster effect is activated (Quick
    Effect): You can send 1 face-up Equip Card you control to the GY; negate the
    activation, and if you do, destroy it. You can only use each effect of "Immortal
    Phoenix Gearfried" once per turn.'
